#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1350
msgid "🎨 Design Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1352
msgid ""
"The SecInterp plugin has been designed following robust software "
"engineering principles to ensure quality and maintainability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1354
msgid "SOLID Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1356
msgid ""
"**SRP (Single Responsibility Principle)**: Each service (Profile, "
"Geology, Structure, Drillhole) has a single, clear responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1357
msgid ""
"**OCP (Open/Closed Principle)**: Exporters are easily extensible through "
"the abstract base class without modifying the core logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1358
msgid ""
"**LSP (Liskov Substitution Principle)**: All concrete exporters can "
"subtitute the `BaseExporter` class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1359
msgid ""
"**ISP (Interface Segregation Principle)**: Service interfaces are focused"
" on their specific domain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1360
msgid ""
"**DIP (Dependency Inversion Principle)**: The controller depends on "
"abstractions and injected services, not on heavy concrete "
"implementations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1362
msgid "Other Patterns and Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1363
msgid ""
"**DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself)**: Intensive use of `utils` modules to "
"centralize mathematical and spatial calculations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1364
msgid ""
"**Separation of Concerns**: Clear distinction between the GUI Layer "
"(Managers), Core Layer (Services), and Data Layer (DataCache)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1368
msgid "🚀 Extensibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1370
msgid "Quick guide for developers wishing to expand the plugin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1372
msgid "Adding a New Service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1373
msgid "Create the new file in `core/services/` (e.g., `seismic_service.py`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1374
msgid "Implement the service logic following the pattern of other services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1375
msgid ""
"Register the service in `controller.py` within the `ProfileController` "
"constructor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1376
msgid ""
"Add the orchestrator method in the controller and connect it to "
"`PreviewManager`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1378
msgid "Adding a New Export Format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1379
msgid "Create a class in `exporters/` that inherits from `BaseExporter`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1380
msgid "Implement the required `export()` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ARCHITECTURE.md:1381
msgid ""
"Register the new exporter in the factory in `orchestrator.py` or the "
"specific export modules."
msgstr ""

